As you stop here to look around, you realize the beauty
of the place where you now stand.  You find the air
around you sweet with the smell of the ocean, the
gentle breeze through the forest carrying the scent
of perpetually blossoming fruit orchards to your 
nostrils. The rough soil becomes here, sand; 
deep feeling of peace pervades your soul as the
wind sings to you alone through the trees.
